{"content": "<style>.sr-collection{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 0 40px;color:#1f1d1a;\n font-family:Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",\"Songti SC\",\"Noto Serif SC\",serif;line-height:1.85}\n.sr-collection h1{font-family:\"Ma Shan Zheng\",\"Songti SC\",serif;font-size:34px;\n letter-spacing:4px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:400}\n.sr-collection .sub{color:#5a554c;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px}\n.sr-collection .rule{height:1px;background:#e3ddd0;margin:24px 0 30px}\n.sr-collection .lead{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ddd0;border-left:3px solid #9e2b25;\n border-radius:6px;padding:16px 20px;margin:0 0 36px;font-size:15.5px}\n.sr-collection .lead b{color:#9e2b25}\n.sr-collection h2{font-family:\"Ma Shan Zheng\",\"Songti SC\",serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:400;\n letter-spacing:2px;margin:40px 0 6px}\n.sr-collection h2+.price{color:#9e2b25;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 14px;letter-spacing:1px}\n.sr-collection p{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15.5px}\n.sr-collection .shots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));\n gap:14px;margin:18px 0 6px;list-style:none;padding:0;justify-content:center}\n.sr-collection .shots li{margin:0}\n.sr-collection .shots.one{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,320px);justify-content:center}\n.sr-collection .shots img{width:100%;display:block;border:1px solid #e3ddd0;border-radius:4px}\n.sr-collection .shots span{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:#6b6559;margin-top:8px;text-align:center}\n.sr-collection .cta{display:inline-block;background:#9e2b25;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;\n padding:13px 30px;border-radius:3px;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;margin:6px 0 10px}\n.sr-collection .cta:hover{background:#86241f}\n.sr-collection .cta.cta-minor{background:#fff;color:#9e2b25;border:1px solid #9e2b25;padding:11px 24px;font-size:15px}\n.sr-collection .cta.cta-minor:hover{background:#f6f1e6}\n.sr-collection .note{font-size:14.5px;color:#6b6559;line-height:1.95}\n.sr-collection .fine{margin-top:40px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #e3ddd0;\n font-size:13.5px;color:#6b6559;line-height:1.95}\n@media (max-width:640px){.sr-collection h1{font-size:27px}.sr-collection h2{font-size:20px}}\n.sr-collection .shots{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}\n.sr-collection .shots li a{display:block;height:100%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ddd0;\n border-radius:6px;padding:14px 16px 12px;color:#45423c}\n.sr-collection .shots li a:hover{border-color:#b03826}\n.sr-collection .shots b{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:2px;\n color:#1f1d1a;margin:0 0 3px;font-family:\"Ma Shan Zheng\",\"Songti SC\",serif}\n.sr-collection .shots span{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#6b6559;line-height:1.75;\n text-align:left;margin:0}\n.sr-collection .shots em{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:13.5px;color:#45423c;\n margin-top:6px;line-height:1.75}\n.sr-collection .shots i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:12.5px;color:#b03826;\n letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid #f0ebdf}\n@media (max-width:900px){.sr-collection .shots{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media (max-width:640px){.sr-collection .shots{gap:10px}.sr-collection .shots b{font-size:17px}}</style>\n<div class=\"sr-collection\">\n<h1>觉醒年代</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">1912 — 1949 年</p>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"lead\">\n  <b>「愿中国青年都摆脱冷气，只是向上走」</b>\n  —— 鲁迅《热风 · 随感录四十一》\n</div>\n\n<h2>手机竖版 · 免费</h2>\n<p class=\"phone-preview\"><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/juexing-phone-ios.png\" alt=\"觉醒年代手机竖版壁纸预览\" style=\"max-width:300px;width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #e3ddd0;border-radius:6px\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p class=\"price\">iPhone / Android 各 1 张 · 免费领取</p>\n<p>觉醒年代的手机竖版壁纸，不带底纹。全十六朝 32 张 + 百家姓 200 张，留邮箱一次全发给你。</p>\n<p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"/collection/#signup\">免费领取 232 张 →</a></p>\n\n<h2>桌面横版</h2>\n<p class=\"desk-preview\"><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/juexing-preview.jpg\" alt=\"觉醒年代桌面横版壁纸预览\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border:1px solid #e3ddd0;border-radius:6px\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p class=\"price\">单朝 ¥12 ｜ 近世辑（四朝）¥39 ｜ 十六朝全套 ¥128</p>\n<p>1x 与 4K 两种规格。宣纸底、朱砂点睛。本朝底纹：铅字（字模托盘）。</p>\n<p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"/collection/#signup\" style=\"background:transparent;border:1px solid #cfc7b8;color:#45423c\">即将开售 · 通知我</a></p>\n\n<h2>读这个朝代的长卷</h2>\n<p>五千年不曾有神来救，五千年也不曾真正倒下。这一卷写最近的一百多年：白话、简体、扫盲、汉字进入计算机——文明在最短的时间里……</p>\n<p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"/5000years/juexing/\">读《觉醒年代》全文 →</a></p>\n</div>\n\n<style id=\"qj-rhythm\">:root{ --sp-sec:clamp(30px,3.5vw,42px); --sp-para:clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px); --sp-block:clamp(24px,2.8vw,32px); --sp-head:clamp(38px,4.2vw,50px);}section{margin-block:0!important;padding:var(--sp-sec) 24px}.verse{padding:var(--sp-sec) 24px}.prose p{margin:var(--sp-para) 0}.prose h2{margin:var(--sp-head) 0 16px}.dispute{margin:var(--sp-block) auto 0}.finale{padding:0}.final-line{margin-top:0;line-height:1.5}.lone{line-height:1.7}footer{padding:56px 24px 48px}.sr-collection p{margin:0 0 16px}.sr-collection h2{margin:44px 0 8px}</style>"}